# ~/.config/fs4/<slot>.env for a WEEKLY RAW slot (stage 1; CPU only). chmod 0600, UNTRACKED. Every <...> comes from a
# path already verified on that host. install_weekly_host.sh refuses while any value is PENDING_* or missing.
FS4_PYTHON=<state>/venv/bin/python
FS4_CODE=<state>/code/PREDICTOR_CURRENT
FS4_COORDINATOR=<ssh-alias-of-the-coordinator-from-this-host>
FS4_COORDINATOR_PYTHON=python3
FS4_CONTROLLER=<coordinator-absolute-path>/code/PREDICTOR_CURRENT/tools/fs4_weekly_campaign.py
FS4_DB=<coordinator-absolute-path>/fs4_weekly/weekly_queue.sqlite
FS4_OWNER=<role>-weekly-raw-<n>
FS4_CAP=PENDING_MEASURED_CAP
FS4_INPUT_MODE=RAW
FS4_POPULATION=EURUSD
FS4_BAR_HOURS=1
# space-separated absolute paths; VALIDATION files are only checked for existence by the installer
FS4_TRAIN_FEATURES=<state>/data/eurusd_features_train.parquet
FS4_TRAIN_TARGETS=<state>/data/eurusd_targets_train.parquet
FS4_VAL_FEATURES=<state>/validation_2024/ps1/batch_001/features_train.parquet <state>/validation_2024/ps1/batch_002/features_train.parquet <state>/validation_2024/ps1/batch_003/features_train.parquet
FS4_VAL_TARGETS=<state>/validation_2024/ps1/batch_001/targets_train.parquet
FS4_OUTPUT_ROOT=<state>/fs4_weekly/terminals
# size-class slots (cap measured per class): SMALL slot FS4_MAX_FEATURES=32 with the small cap; LARGE slot FS4_MIN_FEATURES=33 with the large cap
FS4_MAX_FEATURES=32
FS4_WALL=3h
FS4_TIMEOUT=10500
